  "document": "The Alster Case\nThe Alster Case is a lost 1915 silent film drama directed by J. Charles Haydon and starring Bryant Washburn and Ruth Stonehouse. It was based on a novel, \"The Alster Case\", by Rufus Gillmore. It was produced by the Essanay Company."
